802
00:32:21.570 --> 00:32:23.240
The world's fastest moving glacier,

803
00:32:23.240 --> 00:32:25.150
it moves at something like three meters a day,

804
00:32:25.150 --> 00:32:27.510
near freezing waters, windchill.

805
00:32:27.510 --> 00:32:30.660
It's crazy what he's attempting to do.

806
00:32:30.660 --> 00:32:34.740
And he's been sharing on social media his training swims,

807
00:32:34.740 --> 00:32:36.280
'cause he's in Iceland right now.

