00:33:29.088 --> 00:33:34.088
Japan, is it Tsugaru Strait in Japan,

831
00:33:34.280 --> 00:33:36.172
the Molokai to Oahu

832
00:33:36.172 --> 00:33:38.633
and the North channel.

