863
00:34:56.805 --> 00:34:57.638
He's really interesting guy.

864
00:34:57.638 --> 00:34:59.740
He was inspired by the 1968 Olympics,

865
00:34:59.740 --> 00:35:03.400
the first Mexican to win a swimming medal in the 1968.

866
00:35:03.400 --> 00:35:06.081
