868
00:35:07.840 --> 00:35:09.860
And then over the years,

869
00:35:09.860 --> 00:35:13.140
he and his brothers all got into it and they sold,

870
00:35:13.140 --> 00:35:15.620
like there was no good at that time.

871
00:35:15.620 --> 00:35:19.440
