877
00:35:30.620 --> 00:35:33.310
whatever they could get, good goggles, decent swimsuits.

878
00:35:33.310 --> 00:35:36.920
He ended up connecting with the person

879
00:35:36.920 --> 00:35:40.430
who the Speedo license in the United States in North America

880
00:35:40.430 --> 00:35:42.472
and started to get the good stuff.

881
00:35:42.472 --> 00:35:44.760
And over time there's high school career,

882
00:35:44.760 --> 00:35:47.920
he was going to try to become an Olympian at age 17.

883
00:35:47.920 --> 00:35:51.130
He narrowly missed making the team at age 17,

884
00:35:51.130 --> 00:35:54.717
