891
00:36:09.498 --> 00:36:12.460
to really make a splash.

892
00:36:12.460 --> 00:36:15.750
And after a year, he quit the team

893
00:36:15.750 --> 00:36:17.570
and focused on his academics

894
00:36:17.570 --> 00:36:22.310
and ends up being a high up in government in Mexico.

895
00:36:22.310 --> 00:36:24.890
And so his book is about his swims,

896
00:36:24.890 --> 00:36:28.630
