00:37:01.760 --> 00:37:03.270
So I immediately assumed that,

915
00:37:03.270 --> 00:37:05.020
but that was not actually the case.

916
00:37:07.416 --> 00:37:10.312
He got along fine with Skip,

917
00:37:10.312 --> 00:37:13.060
what he didn't like was basically his role on the team

918
00:37:13.060 --> 00:37:15.720
was he was breaking water for the best women.

919
00:37:15.720 --> 00:37:18.260
And so he just didn't like being in that position

920
00:37:18.260 --> 00:37:19.800
of not being good enough

921
00:37:19.800 --> 00:37:22.330
and he felt like he just wasn't right.

922
00:37:22.330 --> 00:37:24.700
And so he backed off and he doubled down on his business.

923
