925
00:37:33.510 --> 00:37:35.490
while he's still in college.

926
00:37:35.490 --> 00:37:36.990
Becomes this wheeler dealer.

927
00:37:37.940 --> 00:37:41.340
And he still is, but he is.

928
00:37:41.340 --> 00:37:43.010
So anyway, he was attempting to do the double.

929
00:37:43.010 --> 00:37:45.200
He did the English channel double.

