934
00:37:52.340 --> 00:37:55.790
And it was a really glassy day flat day,

935
00:37:55.790 --> 00:37:59.020
and he got to France in 13 hours or so.

936
00:37:59.020 --> 00:38:01.390
He was doing great, came back,

