00:54:18.670 --> 00:54:21.670
Lindsey Krauss wrote a bunch about that,

1329
00:54:21.670 --> 00:54:23.970
that put Felix and into

1330
00:54:23.970 --> 00:54:25.730
kind of a mainstream conversation

1331
00:54:25.730 --> 00:54:27.100
