1334
00:54:31.950 --> 00:54:34.110
but to just absolutely crush it.

1335
00:54:34.110 --> 00:54:38.610
And that image of Alison walking with her daughter

1336
00:54:38.610 --> 00:54:42.800
to me is like one of the iconic images of Tokyo.

1337
00:54:42.800 --> 00:54:43.633
Absolutely.

1338
00:54:43.633 --> 00:54:47.867
She won, I think ended up being bronze in the 400

1339
00:54:47.867 --> 00:54:51.570
