1340
00:54:51.570 --> 00:54:53.000
she defended her gold.

1341
00:54:53.000 --> 00:54:56.031
Her name's escaping me, but she was amazing.

1342
00:54:56.031 --> 00:54:58.500
Alison came in third and then the four by 400,

1343
00:54:58.500 --> 00:55:00.500
the women just destroyed the field.

1344
00:55:00.500 --> 00:55:02.150
I mean, they were ahead by so much

1345
00:55:02.150 --> 00:55:05.110
and she was one of the members of that.

1346
00:55:05.110 --> 00:55:09.733
Now, like the winningest track and field athlete ever,

1347
00:55:09.733 --> 00:55:13.213
