And she did it wearing her own shoes, Saysah,

1349
00:55:16.397 --> 00:55:18.480
I think S-A-Y-S-A-H is the brand.

1350
00:55:18.480 --> 00:55:20.810
So say your sash, I don't know,

1351
00:55:20.810 --> 00:55:22.190
but that's her brand.

1352
00:55:22.190 --> 00:55:25.560
And so, props to two moms.

1353
00:55:25.560 --> 00:55:27.800
'cause you know, Serena Williams gets a lot of credit

1354
00:55:27.800 --> 00:55:29.300
