1356
00:55:30.470 --> 00:55:31.640
and be at the top of her sport,

1357
00:55:31.640 --> 00:55:34.370
and she's gotten to the finals multiple times.

1358
00:55:34.370 --> 00:55:35.635
Now we're talking about,

1359
00:55:35.635 --> 00:55:38.830
this is kind of the first time I can remember mothers

1360
00:55:38.830 --> 00:55:41.620
with young children actually winning gold,

1361
00:55:41.620 --> 00:55:42.940
get becoming the world champion.

1362
00:55:42.940 --> 00:55:43.853
I mean that's.

1363
00:55:44.696 --> 00:55:47.921
