2660
01:50:18.690 --> 01:50:19.740
Thanks again.

2661
01:50:19.740 --> 01:50:22.203
When self care becomes OCD.

2662
01:50:24.334 --> 01:50:26.850
Ted, you wanna tackle this?

2663
01:50:26.850 --> 01:50:28.260
Sure, sure.

2664
01:50:28.260 --> 01:50:33.150
I think that it's important

2665
01:50:33.150 --> 01:50:38.150
to be aware of the present moment.

2666
01:50:38.900 --> 01:50:41.220
And I think oftentimes we get into

2667
01:50:41.220 --> 01:50:44.018
the rituals that we're doing

2668
01:50:44.018 --> 01:50:48.350
and we lose the fact that every single moment

2669
01:50:48.350 --> 01:50:51.570
is a frigging miracle

2670
01:50:51.570 --> 01:50:55.440
and it's so intense and overwhelming

2671
01:50:55.440 --> 01:50:58.815
that I think oftentimes we step aside

2672
01:50:58.815 --> 01:51:01.210
and we don't allow that in.

2673
01:51:01.210 --> 01:51:03.757
So I just remember on yoga retreats, years ago with Max,

2674
01:51:03.757 --> 01:51:06.570
and being in triangle pose and looking out the window

2675
01:51:06.570 --> 01:51:09.656
and seeing Zaka lake, I don't know.

2676
01:51:09.656 --> 01:51:11.171
Did you ever go to Zaka Lake?

2677
01:51:11.171 --> 01:51:12.674
Anyway, just looking out the window

2678
01:51:12.674 --> 01:51:15.260
and seeing this beautiful blue sky and these green hills

2679
01:51:15.260 --> 01:51:16.730
and then all of a sudden, just weeping.

2680
01:51:16.730 --> 01:51:18.380
And I thought, what is that?

2681
01:51:18.380 --> 01:51:19.907
Why is that?

2682
01:51:19.907 --> 01:51:21.360
And I think I realized

2683
01:51:21.360 --> 01:51:24.080
it was just because I was so overcome

2684
01:51:24.080 --> 01:51:26.660
by the beauty of the moment.

2685
01:51:26.660 --> 01:51:29.180
And I think oftentimes we lose

2686
01:51:29.180 --> 01:51:31.360
and I share this a lot on retreats

2687
01:51:31.360 --> 01:51:32.580
or different conversations.

2688
01:51:32.580 --> 01:51:34.260
It's like, you know, this glass, right.

2689
01:51:34.260 --> 01:51:38.140
We can just feel the shape of it

2690
01:51:38.140 --> 01:51:42.580
and the immense thought that goes into it,

2691
01:51:42.580 --> 01:51:44.756
or, one thing I was thinking is,

2692
01:51:44.756 --> 01:51:48.310
when you're journaling, how often do you stop

2693
01:51:48.310 --> 01:51:50.060
and take a magnifying glass

2694
01:51:50.060 --> 01:51:53.693
and look at the fibers inside the page,

2695
01:51:53.693 --> 01:51:56.058
or like Deepak Chopra used to say,

2696
01:51:56.058 --> 01:51:57.550
don't just look and go,

2697
01:51:57.550 --> 01:51:59.640
oh wow, those flowers, they look so beautiful.

2698
01:51:59.640 --> 01:52:04.630
Like stop for a second and feel the immense miracle

2699
01:52:04.630 --> 01:52:07.440
that really is the moment.

2700
01:52:07.440 --> 01:52:11.913
And I don't know if this happens because,

2701
01:52:11.913 --> 01:52:15.488
you know, being someone who had,

2702
01:52:15.488 --> 01:52:18.710
who felt like I was gonna lose my life at some point,

2703
01:52:18.710 --> 01:52:21.284
and then being a sober guy now

2704
01:52:21.284 --> 01:52:25.070
and having that sort of deep sense

2705
01:52:25.070 --> 01:52:27.101
of gratitude for the moment,

2706
01:52:27.101 --> 01:52:30.157
or if that's something you can develop

2707
01:52:30.157 --> 01:52:33.220
as someone who hasn't had an experience like that.

2708
01:52:33.220 --> 01:52:35.810
But I really feel like no matter what it is,

2709
01:52:35.810 --> 01:52:38.090
no matter where you are, no matter what you look at,

2710
01:52:38.090 --> 01:52:40.490
whether it's a person or a thing,

2711
01:52:40.490 --> 01:52:43.540
there's this and it's perception.

2712
01:52:43.540 --> 01:52:44.960
And they talk about this a lot,

2713
01:52:44.960 --> 01:52:46.860
but it's shifting your perception.

2714
01:52:46.860 --> 01:52:50.690
So, just one more thought,

2715
01:52:50.690 --> 01:52:53.123
which, they talk about astronomers, right?

2716
01:52:54.941 --> 01:52:56.330
You need to be happy shoveling the shit

2717
01:52:56.330 --> 01:52:59.434
before you can be happy doing the other stuff.

2718
01:52:59.434 --> 01:53:02.440
And until you can be happy doing that stuff,

2719
01:53:02.440 --> 01:53:06.290
I think it will become monotonous.

2720
01:53:06.290 --> 01:53:09.160
So a solution, I would say Nate,

2721
01:53:09.160 --> 01:53:13.440
is either to shift your perspective

2722
01:53:13.440 --> 01:53:16.150
on what is actually happening,

2723
01:53:16.150 --> 01:53:17.363
or maybe take a break.

2724
01:53:18.236 --> 01:53:19.069
You know, I think the simple thing

2725
01:53:19.069 --> 01:53:21.720
is just to take a break for a moment and live free

2726
01:53:21.720 --> 01:53:25.700
and don't be attached to that routine

2727
01:53:25.700 --> 01:53:29.820
and have this free experience of doing things

2728
01:53:29.820 --> 01:53:32.330
and see what comes up from there.

2729
01:53:32.330 --> 01:53:35.100
Should we just get up and leave and let Ted take over?

2730
01:53:35.100 --> 01:53:39.020
I think he just solidified his value.

2731
01:53:39.020 --> 01:53:41.220
I'm sorry for loafing for all this months.

2732
01:53:42.360 --> 01:53:44.570
No beautifully put, I love it.

2733
01:53:44.570 --> 01:53:48.953
I think it's about your relationship

2734
01:53:48.953 --> 01:53:50.840
to the practices and the rituals.

2735
01:53:50.840 --> 01:53:54.740
And what I sense is an extreme level of rigidity

2736
01:53:54.740 --> 01:53:56.770
where there's a lot of self-judgment packed

2737
01:53:56.770 --> 01:53:59.190
into the doing or the not doing.

2738
01:53:59.190 --> 01:54:02.530
There's a referendum on how you feel about yourself

2739
01:54:02.530 --> 01:54:03.400
and who you are

2740
01:54:03.400 --> 01:54:05.440
that's based upon whether you're adhering

2741
01:54:05.440 --> 01:54:08.210
to a very strict set of circumstances.

2742
01:54:08.210 --> 01:54:11.090
Yes, of course, that becomes unsustainable.

2743
01:54:11.090 --> 01:54:15.380
And I think the solution does lie in holding these things

2744
01:54:15.380 --> 01:54:16.820
a little bit more lightly

2745
01:54:16.820 --> 01:54:19.170
and anchoring yourself in the moment

2746
01:54:19.170 --> 01:54:22.260
and understanding that it's not the ritual per se

2747
01:54:22.260 --> 01:54:26.060
or the practice as much as it is your awareness

2748
01:54:26.060 --> 01:54:27.200
around the practice

2749
01:54:27.200 --> 01:54:30.717
and your ability to be present with these practices

2750
01:54:30.717 --> 01:54:32.830
that are the conveyor belt

2751
01:54:32.830 --> 01:54:35.150
to the transformation that you're seeking.

2752
01:54:35.150 --> 01:54:38.610
So it sounds like you're holding on so tightly

2753
01:54:38.610 --> 01:54:40.100
and you've been doing it for so long.

2754
01:54:40.100 --> 01:54:42.820
Like I would suggest that if you've been meditating

2755
01:54:42.820 --> 01:54:47.400
