2756
01:54:47.400 --> 01:54:50.300
there's something broken in this practice altogether,

2757
01:54:50.300 --> 01:54:53.180
because that's not the intended result

2758
01:54:53.180 --> 01:54:55.100
that we're looking for here.

2759
01:54:55.100 --> 01:54:57.820
So what exactly are you doing?

2760
01:54:57.820 --> 01:55:01.190
What is your relationship to that doing?

2761
01:55:01.190 --> 01:55:04.730
And, if you're coming out of it resentful in burden,

2762
01:55:04.730 --> 01:55:07.530
then something is fundamentally wrong.

2763
01:55:07.530 --> 01:55:10.500
So it's about letting go of the attachment

2764
01:55:10.500 --> 01:55:12.710
or the meaning that you're attaching

2765
01:55:12.710 --> 01:55:15.411
to the results of this practice

2766
01:55:15.411 --> 01:55:18.840
that's causing you to self-flagellate

2767
01:55:18.840 --> 01:55:20.720
