2774
01:55:32.200 --> 01:55:34.450
That's what you need to examine here.

2775
01:55:34.450 --> 01:55:37.063
And if you are gonna journal journal about that.

2776
01:55:39.170 --> 01:55:40.650
And I'll just add one more thought

2777
01:55:40.650 --> 01:55:42.660
that came into my head is,

2778
01:55:42.660 --> 01:55:45.120
spent listening to Rom Doss, right.

