01:56:15.520 --> 01:56:17.200
I feel like it's upside down.

2796
01:56:17.200 --> 01:56:21.840
Like the priority is on like the practice

2797
01:56:21.840 --> 01:56:24.770
as if the practice itself is the result,

2798
01:56:24.770 --> 01:56:27.580
