2803
01:56:35.830 --> 01:56:37.203
like behold the glass.

2804
01:56:38.187 --> 01:56:40.654
There is no glass.

2805
01:56:40.654 --> 01:56:43.222
It's like, you know, you wanna take that,

2806
01:56:43.222 --> 01:56:47.787
like you can't live your life that way,

2807
01:56:47.787 --> 01:56:50.440
but you can find moments.

2808
01:56:50.440 --> 01:56:53.170
And so like those mindfulness moments,

2809
01:56:53.170 --> 01:56:55.253
maybe that's, it mindfulness moments.

2810
01:56:57.160 --> 01:56:59.870
Because if the practice is drained of its beauty,

2811
01:56:59.870 --> 01:57:02.990
