the Delta variants sort of like put

3394
02:20:54.489 --> 02:20:56.193
a little bit of a damper on that,

3395
02:20:56.193 --> 02:20:57.460
but people do still come to the studio.

3396
02:20:57.460 --> 02:20:58.920
So if you're in Malibu,

3397
02:20:58.920 --> 02:21:01.260
then definitely come and check us out.

3398
02:21:01.260 --> 02:21:03.750
We have a limited amount of classes,

3399
02:21:03.750 --> 02:21:05.230
but we also do online classes.

3400
02:21:05.230 --> 02:21:06.840
So if you're looking to get into yoga,

3401
02:21:06.840 --> 02:21:09.800
I'm happy to sort of give you a little bit of a thing.

3402
02:21:09.800 --> 02:21:12.400
Actually, I started streaming once the pandemic hit,

3403
02:21:13.282 --> 02:21:14.592
I started streaming.

3404
02:21:14.592 --> 02:21:16.307
Adam did a little piece for the New York Times,

3405
02:21:16.307 --> 02:21:17.698
which was great.

3406
02:21:17.698 --> 02:21:21.435
But I just, because I felt like back then,

3407
02:21:21.435 --> 02:21:23.860
it was really important to start to share

3408
02:21:23.860 --> 02:21:25.830
our resources as individuals,

3409
02:21:25.830 --> 02:21:28.312
I really felt like that was important.

3410
02:21:28.312 --> 02:21:30.100
So I thought if there's anything that I know how to do,

3411
02:21:30.100 --> 02:21:31.900
it's help people move through stress.

3412
02:21:31.900 --> 02:21:33.340
And it was a really stressful time

3413
02:21:33.340 --> 02:21:35.655
so I felt like that was important.

3414
02:21:35.655 --> 02:21:37.072
And I kept doing that once a week.

3415
02:21:37.072 --> 02:21:39.190
So usually on Mondays, I do a little yoga for athletes.

3416
02:21:39.190 --> 02:21:43.070
My friend is the Race Director for the Malibu Half Marathon,

3417
02:21:43.070 --> 02:21:44.460
which happens in November.

3418
02:21:44.460 --> 02:21:47.511
So we kind of stream two,

3419
02:21:47.511 --> 02:21:49.238
my channels and her channel,

3420
02:21:49.238 --> 02:21:52.560
and otherwise it's for the members that come and join us.

3421
02:21:52.560 --> 02:21:56.770
But I'm happy to have any of your listeners be a guest.

3422
02:21:56.770 --> 02:21:59.020
You do a Jackson retreat in the winter.

3423
02:21:59.020 --> 02:22:00.420
That's right.

3424
02:22:00.420 --> 02:22:02.516
So every year we go to Jackson Hole.

3425
02:22:02.516 --> 02:22:05.103
Tony Horton, who's a good buddy of mine,

3426
02:22:05.103 --> 02:22:10.103
