3427
02:22:10.860 --> 02:22:14.542
I laugh because it's like one of the most fun.

3428
02:22:14.542 --> 02:22:16.559
Sound like so chest pounding though,

3429
02:22:16.559 --> 02:22:18.110
like a little intimidated.

3430
02:22:18.110 --> 02:22:19.940
Well, it's funny people like,

3431
02:22:19.940 --> 02:22:22.390
I'm a snowboarder or I can't really see.

3432
02:22:22.390 --> 02:22:24.020
And Jackson Hole is intense, right?

3433
02:22:24.020 --> 02:22:26.870
So there's plenty of things to do

3434
02:22:26.870 --> 02:22:31.063
as far as plenty of terrain for beginners, intermediate,

3435
02:22:31.063 --> 02:22:34.284
and there's plenty of people who will come on the retreat

3436
02:22:34.284 --> 02:22:36.270
