3437
02:22:36.270 --> 02:22:38.050
the Grand Tetons are right down the block,

3438
02:22:38.050 --> 02:22:39.790
the Yellowstone is around the corner

3439
02:22:39.790 --> 02:22:42.050
so it's an amazing place.

3440
02:22:42.050 --> 02:22:44.100
So you don't necessarily have to.

3441
02:22:44.100 --> 02:22:45.490
And the thing is we do yoga in the morning,

3442
02:22:45.490 --> 02:22:46.810
yoga in the evening.

3443
02:22:46.810 --> 02:22:48.680
Tony's a little bit more of a chest pounder

3444
02:22:48.680 --> 02:22:52.425
where my whole idea is to help people in the beginning

3445
02:22:52.425 --> 02:22:54.190
or the end of the day,

3446
02:22:54.190 --> 02:22:56.690
either recovery at the end of the day, so yin,

3447
02:22:56.690 --> 02:22:58.640
or in the beginning of the day,

3448
02:22:58.640 --> 02:23:00.010
